@Takwene_HostAddress = https://localhost:7000

### Register
POST {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "test@takwene.local",
  "password": "Test@12345"
}

### Login (seeded admin; copy accessToken and refreshToken from the response)
POST {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@takwene.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Who am I
GET {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>

### Refresh (rotates: the old refresh token stops working)
POST {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<refreshToken>"
}

### Revoke (logout)
POST {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/auth/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<refreshToken>"
}
